---
description: TRISSEA product UI/design guidance
globs: apps/admin/**, apps/passenger/**, apps/driver/**, design/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Read `design/DESIGN-BIBLE.md`, `design/SCREEN-INVENTORY.md`. Designs must be original and safety-first, low-data, accessible, responsive with precise hierarchy. Show stale GPS, uncertainty in ETAs, empty/loading/error/offline states, meaningful buttons and consent before switching mode/fare. Do not clone Grab's branding or trade dress.

The binding mobile-specific rules are `design/MOBILE-DESIGN-RULES.md`, `design/MOBILE-SCREEN-ACCEPTANCE.md` and project skill `.agents/skills/trissea-mobile-design/SKILL.md`. External repository skill precedence is documented in `design/MOBILE-AGENT-REPOS.md`.
